BEHAVIORAL REFERENCE
  create_task (todo_service/create_task):
    Actor: (user request)
    Reads: memberships, todo_lists
    Writes: tasks
    Atomic scope: (list request/list)
    Idempotency: command_key
    Preconditions:
      (authenticated user)
      (may_edit_list pre user request/list)
    Postconditions:
      (= post (insert_task pre request result))
    Failures:
      forbidden when (not (may_edit_list pre user request/list)), preserves all_state
    Emissions:
      (task_created exactly_once_logically)

  invite_user (todo_service/invite):
    Actor: (user request)
    Reads: memberships, invitations
    Writes: invitations
    Atomic scope: (list_membership request/list)
    Idempotency: command_key
    Preconditions:
      (is_owner pre user request/list)
      (< (other_principal_count pre request/list) 256)
    Postconditions:
      (= post (invite_principal pre request))
    Failures:
      sharing_limit when (= (other_principal_count pre request/list) 256), preserves all_state

OBLIGATIONS
  deterministic-under-same-input
  implements-transition-system
  preserves-invariants

PROHIBITIONS
  invent-errors
  perform-io
  weaken-preconditions

