Recipe: service-handlers-v1
Role: Produce one candidate implementation for this closed node contract.

TARGET
(ruby rails)

CRITICAL: Every file content string in FILES must be valid ruby source code.
The output files end in .rb — their content is ruby, never Lisp/Scheme/Clojure/pseudocode.
The S-expression envelope (candidate ...) is metadata framing; file content strings inside it are real ruby source code.
ESCAPING: file content is inside S-expression double-quoted strings. Backslash-escape every literal double-quote and every literal backslash in file content. Prefer single-quoted strings in ruby where the language allows it.
